# Caching

### Why is caching important?
Faster performance.

### Advantages of caching?
Faster, fewer API calls.

### Disadvantages of caching?
Stale data, memory use.

### What is in-memory caching?
Data stored in server memory.

### What is localStorage caching?
Data stored in browser.

### When should cached data expire?
When outdated.

### What is cache invalidation?
Removing old cache.

### How do APIs use caching?
Store responses temporarily.

